Actually, the wish for 3 blessed scrolls of identify is not very likely 
to be granted. Better wish for 3 normal scrolls of identify, join them to
the collection which you most probably have at that point and bless them
all with holy water (which you also usually have at that point - or you can
also wish for). This way you have ton of blessed identify scrolls in one
go (and thus pretty good chance of having identified everything you carry)...

>It always seemed to me that for awhile, you could only identify
